# The critical improvement: `Expected vs Actual`

This should be the heart of LoopGoal.

After every iteration:

```text
TASK MAP
   vs
REPOSITORY INVENTORY
   vs
GIT DIFF
   vs
VERIFICATION
   vs
RULES/SKILLS
```

Example:

```text
Requirement: Pagination for user listing

Expected
────────────────────────────
api/v1/users/list.mo       PASS
services/user.mo           PASS
repositories/user.mo       PASS
testing/users/list_test.mo FAIL
docs/api/users.md          MISSING

Actual
────────────────────────────
4 files changed

Result
────────────────────────────
2 PASS
1 FAIL
1 MISSING
```

Therefore:

```text
COMPLETED = false
```

No matter what the AI says.

