## This is the real differentiator

Most agent loops are approximately:

```text
goal
 ↓
AI
 ↓
code
 ↓
tests
 ↓
done
```

Your target can be:

```text
goal
 ↓
complete repository inventory
 ↓
requirements
 ↓
task graph
 ↓
file mapping
 ↓
rules + skills mapping
 ↓
AI implementation
 ↓
repository re-scan
 ↓
expected/actual reconciliation
 ↓
missing-work discovery
 ↓
verification
 ↓
compliance
 ↓
evidence
 ↓
final audit
 ↓
done
```

That is a **much more serious architecture for autonomous software engineering**.

And importantly, it remains completely language-agnostic: whether the repository has 100 Go API files, 300 Python files, 500 TypeScript files, or a mixed monorepo, the **inventory → mapping → reconciliation → compliance** mechanism stays the same.
